    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d901">

                <pb facs="0939" n="819" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg819"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Meyer to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-11"><hi rendition="#italic">July 11,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>* * * Russia’s plenipotentiary and delegates will sail on <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Kaiser Wilhelm</hi> due New York August 9. Mouravieff arrived here Sunday
                    morning for instructions, taken ill yesterday, causing Russian minister for
                    foreign affairs some concern, as plenipotentiary has just come from a cure at
                    Contrexeville.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Meyer.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
